cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HazardNet, its forecasts or its published outputs in academic work or an operational product, please cite this repository as below."
title: "HazardNet: multi-hazard early warning for Bangladesh agriculture"
abstract: >-
  HazardNet publishes 7- and 15-day multi-hazard outlooks for the 64 districts of
  Bangladesh across eight hazard classes, with dual-track severity values and published
  provenance for every number. Model code, dataset collection procedures, training and
  benchmarking are research-private; only results and outputs are public. Master's thesis,
  Department of Agrometeorology, Bangladesh Agricultural University. Supervised by
  Dr. Ahmed Khairul Hasan; co-supervised by the Department of Computer Science and
  Mathematics, BAU.
type: thesis
authors:
  - family-names: Shuvo
    given-names: Ashif Ahmed
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5734-1519"
    website: "https://github.com/myself-aas"
    affiliation: "Department of Agrometeorology, Bangladesh Agricultural University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/myself-aas/HazardNet"
url: "https://www.hazardnet.live"
license: MIT
keywords:
